OL,3,GNEWSAFootball on prescription is
OL,4,Aboosting mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA repeat of a scheme that offers
OL,7,Fwatching football as a way of improving
OL,8,Fmental health, has been prescribed by
OL,9,Fbosses at a Gloucestershire football
OL,10,Fclub.
OL,12,FFootball on Prescription saw GPs refer
OL,13,F30 people to the Forest Green Rovers
OL,14,Fground in Nailsworth last season, as
OL,15,Fpart of a pilot developed by club
OL,16,Fchairman Dale Vince and Labour MP for
OL,17,FStroud Dr Simon Opher.
OL,19,FThe success of the pilot has encouraged
OL,20,Fthe pair to bring the scheme back for
OL,21,Fthe 2026/27 football season.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
